OL,3,CCristiano Ronaldo marries long-time
OL,4,Cgirlfriend Georgina Rodriguez in
OL,5,CPortugal
OL,7,FFootball icon Cristiano Ronaldo has
OL,8,Fmarried his long-term partner Georgina
OL,9,FRodriguez in a civil ceremony in
OL,10,FPortugal.
OL,12,FThe newlywed couple shared a picture
OL,13,Fof their wedding rings on Instagram,
OL,14,Fexactly a year after they announced
OL,15,Ftheir engagement.
OL,17,FThe post soon racked up more than 24
OL,18,Fmillion likes with fans all over the
OL,19,Fworld sending their congratulations.
OL,26,@lD@YrtqD@Ert
