OL,3,CCristiano Ronaldo marries long-time
OL,4,Cgirlfriend Georgina Rodriguez in
OL,5,CPortugal
OL,7,FInternet personality Matty Farias
OL,8,Fcommented: "Thank you for having me
OL,9,Fbrother, the wedding was beautiful."
OL,11,FThe wedding was intimate, taking place
OL,12,Fin Cascais, a coastal resort town
OL,13,Fabout 20 miles west of the Portuguese
OL,14,Fcapital Lisbon. Their five children
OL,15,Fwere among those who attended the
OL,16,Fceremony.
OL,18,FThe pair have been together for 10
OL,19,Fyears and reportedly met in a Gucci
OL,20,Fstore in Madrid where Rodriguez used
OL,21,Fto work.
