OL,3,CCristiano Ronaldo marries long-time
OL,4,Cgirlfriend Georgina Rodriguez in
OL,5,CPortugal
OL,7,FOn August 11, 2025, Georgina Rodriguez
OL,8,Fshared a picture of her engagement
OL,9,Fring on social media with the caption:
OL,10,F"Yes, I do. In this and all of my
OL,11,Flives," translated from Spanish.
OL,13,FRonaldo, aged 41, tied the knot just
OL,14,Ffour days before his club Al Nassr
OL,15,Fstart their 2026-27 Saudi Pro League
OL,16,Fcampaign.
OL,26,@lD@YrtoD@brt
