OL,3,CCristiano Ronaldo marries long-time
OL,4,Cgirlfriend Georgina Rodriguez in
OL,5,CPortugal
OL,7,FThe Portuguese player is known world-
OL,8,Fwide for sporting talent. Ronaldo has
OL,9,Fscored nearly 1,000 goals in his
OL,10,Ffootball career, playing for teams
OL,11,Fincluding Manchester United, Real
OL,12,FMadrid, Al Nassr and Portugal.
OL,14,FThis year he competed in his sixth
OL,15,FWorld Cup and was the first player in
OL,16,Fhistory to play in knockout stages
OL,17,Faged 41 years or older.
OL,26,@lD@Yrt
