OL,5,CPortugal
OL,7,FSadly he did not make it to the
OL,8,Fquarter finals as Spain knocked out
OL,9,FPortugal by scoring 1-0 in the round
OL,10,Fof 16 match in Texas.
OL,12,FAs the wedding was private there are
OL,13,Fno other images of the ceremony yet,
OL,14,For any details of a honeymoon.
